8w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/evolve-screenshot.png 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>1) <strong>Evolve<\/strong> - This awesome theme is easy to set up and has a ton of benefits:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Responsive design\u00a0for multiple devices<\/li>\n<li>A cool\u00a0bootstrap and parallax slider<\/li>\n<li>A grid-like framework that makes it easy to adjust page design<\/li>\n<li>Page and blog templates<\/li>\n<li>Tons of fonts<\/li>\n<li>and more!<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>This theme pack is easy-to-use yet provides enough flexibility and functionality so that you can provide your site visitors with a unique and custom-feeling\u00a0experience.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-198-0-0-4\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor\" data-index=\"4\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Photo Gallery for Displaying Images<\/h3>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p><a href=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/gallery-screenshot-2.png\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-220\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-220 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/gallery-screenshot-2-300x240.png\" alt=\"Gallery plug-in\" width=\"300\" height=\"240\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/gallery-screenshot-2-300x240.png 300w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/gallery-screenshot-2.png 718w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>2) <strong>Gallery<\/strong> - This comprehensive, yet easy-to-use gallery plug-in allows you to get a photo gallery on your site in minutes so you can showcase screenshots of your games and more! \u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-198-0-0-5\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor\" data-index=\"5\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Search Engine Optimization (SEO) Tools<\/h3>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p><a href=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/yoast-screenshot-1.png\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-219\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-219 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/yoast-screenshot-1-300x183.png\" alt=\"yoast-screenshot-1\" width=\"300\" height=\"183\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/yoast-screenshot-1-300x183.png 300w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/yoast-screenshot-1-768x467.png 768w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/yoast-screenshot-1-1024x623.png 1024w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/yoast-screenshot-1-570x350.png 570w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/yoast-screenshot-1.png 1936w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>3) <strong>Yoast SEO<\/strong>\u00a0- Improve your WordPress SEO with this powerful plug-in. Write better content and have a fully optimized WordPress site.<\/p>\n<p>Take your content to the next level and get your video game found through search engines!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-198-0-0-6\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor\" data-index=\"6\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Contact Forms to Communicate with Visitors<\/h3>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p><a href=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/contact-plugin.png\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-229\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-229 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/contact-plugin-300x232.png\" alt=\"Contact Us Plug-in\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ga